</div>
<div>
<p class="n-lead" style="margin:0;max-width:50ch">This guide collects the information you choose to submit through its two forms. The hosting and font providers also process the limited technical information needed to deliver the site. This page explains what is collected, why, how long it is kept, and how to reach the editor.</p>
<div class="n-small" style="margin-top:14px">Effective September 9, 2026 &#183; Last updated September 9, 2026</div>
</div>
</div>
